   "markdown": "# The Fenwick shop\n\n*From Jon Inggs's pages · [the Wayback Machine's copy](https://web.archive.org/web/20170702000000/http://tree.example.org/html/shop.htm) · captured 2 July 2017*\n\n![The shop](photo:shop)\n\n*The Fenwick shop in Townsville, about 1890.*\n\nAlbert Quill Fenwick (1850-1921) opened the shop in 1880. His son **Frank Fenwick** ran it from 1910.\n\nSee [the photographs](story:photos).\n"
  }
